### LOGIN-10 - Generate client token

POST https://localhost:7094/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "gabriel@example.com",
  "password": "Example123!"
}

### LOGIN-10.2 - Current user with valid token

GET https://localhost:7094/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..nksn68gWxS-oSimZ8t0-DmCmz9YO180SRWcgJIXxeKE

### LOGIN-10.3 - Invalid token

GET https://localhost:7094/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer this-is-not-a-valid-jwt

### LOGIN-10.4 - Tampered token

GET https://localhost:7094/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..nksn68gWxS-oSimZ8t0-DmCmz9YO180SRWcgJIXxeKF
